Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 17:19:09 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] CI S2, piece 7a: full-red.yml runs full-red.ps1 after each
 Full run (Part of #4104)

The workflow: a workflow_run of Full on main, guarded to this repository's own run made by workflow_run or by hand (a fork's pull request
whose branch is named main also matches the branches filter), queued (queue: max) so a burst drops no alert, issues: write only. The
ci.yml light step that runs the script's offline test, the catalog suite flipped to exists and naming full-red.yml report, Full red in
the merge rule's exclusion list, and FullRedWorkflowTests (the if: against a fork, a pull_request run, push, another branch).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
